    <string name="ui_wireless_pairing_and_the_execution_engine_are_built_in_activate_o">Wireless pairing and the execution engine are built in. Activate on Android 11+ without a computer, companion app, or enabled AccessibilityService. Reactivate after a reboot. Overlay controls let you approve and stop tasks.</string>
    <string name="ui_your_goal_app_list_and_relevant_ui_text_are_sent_to_your_model_pr">Your goal, app list, and relevant UI text are sent to your model provider. Screenshots are sent when that tool is used.\n\nPP-OCRv6 tiny runs on-device with bundled models. Recognized text can be sent to your provider as task context.\n\nKeys are encrypted with Android Keystore. History and logs stay on-device. Passwords, verification codes, and device unlock require manual handling. Sensitive-action detection is heuristic and may miss unfamiliar controls.</string>
